' purpose: arena delegates numerical encoding to the same Rust training implementation
' covers: apps/arena/src/feature_adapter.rs
' covers: apps/arena/tests/feature_parity.rs
' status: SOURCE ONLY; compilation, parity tests and runtime activation remain unverified.
@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
left to right direction
title Arena shared418 — one numerical encoder, no learned-selector activation
actor "Detached authorized feature data\ncaller meter / candidate" as INPUT <<host>>
component "arena::feature_adapter\nencode_shared418 / encode_belief_batch" as ADAPTER <<app>>
component "training_native::features\nshared418 formulas and flattening" as FEATURES <<app>>
component "training_native::numerical_belief\npaired readout/context for batch" as BELIEF <<app>>
component "Fresh f64[418] values\nno model activation or inference permit" as OUTPUT <<app>>
component "Persisted literal parity test\nsource only, not executed" as TEST <<host>>
INPUT ARROW_MAIN ADAPTER : retain caller-owned work and boundary context
ADAPTER ARROW_MAIN FEATURES : numerical single-candidate route
ADAPTER ARROW_MAIN BELIEF : paired batch route
BELIEF ARROW_MAIN FEATURES : derive one readout/context per batch
FEATURES ARROW_MAIN OUTPUT : identical implementation, no arena-side formulas
TEST ARROW_OPTIONAL ADAPTER : future bits/fees/literal comparison
note bottom of OUTPUT
Existing synthetic smoke remains synthetic
Baseline policy and TS engine stay unchanged
No trained artifact, deployment or activation
Runtime parity and budget fit remain unproved
end note
@enduml
